cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite material from this archive, please use the metadata below. Per-session citations appear on each transcript page in the search site."
title: "Techspressionist Salon Archive"
abstract: >-
  A searchable, citable transcript archive of the Techspressionist Salon,
  a monthly gathering of artists working with technology, running since
  September 2020. Transcripts are timestamped and speaker-attributed, and
  each segment links to the corresponding moment in the source recording.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Goldberg
    given-names: Colin
    email: colin@goldberg.art
repository-code: "https://github.com/techspressionism/techspressionism-archive"
url: "https://techspressionism.com/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - techspressionism
  - digital art
  - new media art
  - art and technology
  - artist talks
  - oral history
  - transcripts
